Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in host session D-Bus forwarding

Downstream Omarchy patch, developed with substantial LLM assistance.
The upstream submission was closed under Asahi Linux's LLM policy:
https://github.com/AsahiLinux/muvm/pull/251

